@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 # The build vars beginning with "OF_" can be exported in vendorsetup.sh, or can be declared in a device tree make (ie, ".mk") file
 #
 # Copyright (C) 2019-2026 OrangeFox Recovery Project
-# Date: 26 January 2026
